  "2026-10-25T01:40:03.570Z",codex-agent,"CI run 40151238474 passed all 299 behavioral tests on Node 22 and 26, but refused full coverage because the Git error class field initializer was not measured through the separately loaded CLI graph. Added a real in-process SDK harness test for native missing-item and generic ownership refusal statuses. It passes and measures the initializer twice. Reverting the transport function fails this new regression (1 failed, exit 1); source restored. Total behavioral revert probes: 13. No coverage exclusions or threshold changes."
  "2026-10-25T04:09:03.988Z",codex-agent,Reopened implementation after the read-only review found post-commit privacy refusal and an angle-bracket file-URL bypass. Add pure input admission before all command dispatch and SDK-backed privacy scanning with normalization for any proven SDK misses. Measure every mutating command against rejected input encodings using exact full-tracker snapshots and empty-receipt assertions. Preserve existing completed evidence; add new revert proofs and wait for full npm/Bun CI gates.
  "2026-10-25T04:33:04.649Z",codex-agent,"Review remediation: pure CLI admission now checks every content argument/flag/author before dispatch; SDK mutation entries check privacy before leases/heartbeats, and settings preflight re-reads inside its audit lock. The Cartesian test passed 3514 refused inputs over 16 mutating variants, 50 encodings and 69 text positions; separate SDK matrix passed 1050 refusals over 21 entries; 37 malformed domain cases passed. Every case fingerprints all tracker bytes, directories, links, runtime and history and captures stdout: zero changes, zero partial receipts. Native handoff regressions pass for ordinary and angle-file-URL input."
