  "2026-10-25T11:46:50.773Z",codex-agent,"A final URL-grammar control exposed file URLs with implicit roots: file-implicit-path (file:var/private/project), file-dot-relative (file:./var/private/project), file-parent-relative (file:../var/private/project), file-empty-root (file:). WHATWG URL grammar resolves each to an absolute local root; raw SDK scanner misses all four. The common guard now refuses file schemes before stripping labels. The new property covers all 19 registry variants (76 refused calls with full tracker/history byte snapshots and no partial receipts) and both renderers (8 safe documents). Behavioral removal of only this guard makes node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern=\"implicit-root file URLs\" test/privacy-routes.test.ts fail 1/1, exit 1; restored immediately. Cumulative round-3 proofs: 20 probes / 21 expected failures. Shared harness helpers preserve the zero-duplication threshold."
